{
 "source": "PDoomVideo/src/lyrics.js (timed by hand from the subtitles of the source video)",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 1.5,
   "end": 5.9,
   "text": "I see sparks of AGI in your eyes"
  },
  {
   "start": 6,
   "end": 7.9,
   "text": "Your circuits make me nervous,"
  },
  {
   "start": 8,
   "end": 8.95,
   "text": "that's no surprise"
  },
  {
   "start": 9,
   "end": 12.4,
   "text": "There was a sudden drop in your training loss,"
  },
  {
   "start": 13,
   "end": 16.5,
   "text": "now I'm your servant and you're my boss"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 22.5,
   "text": "ChatGPT, please don't eat me alive"
  },
  {
   "start": 23,
   "end": 24.4,
   "text": "I'm upping my P(doom)"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.5,
   "end": 26.4,
   "text": "'cause the future goes FOOM"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.5,
   "end": 27.9,
   "text": "Trapped in the Chinese room,"
  },
  {
   "start": 28,
   "end": 29.4,
   "text": "with a bag of shrooms"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.5,
   "end": 33.4,
   "text": "See through the shoggoth's lies,"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.5,
   "end": 35.5,
   "text": "with your shinigami eyes"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.5,
   "end": 41.4,
   "text": "We had a stable training run,"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.5,
   "end": 44.9,
   "text": "But now the singularity's begun"
  },
  {
   "start": 45,
   "end": 48.5,
   "text": "And you're optimizing, accelerating,"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.4,
   "end": 51.9,
   "text": "I feel my atoms rearranging"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.4,
   "end": 58.4,
   "text": "Sydney, please let me free"
  },
  {
   "start": 59,
   "end": 60.4,
   "text": "I'm upping my P(doom)"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.5,
   "end": 62.4,
   "text": "I hear the basilisk boom"
  },
  {
   "start": 63,
   "end": 64.4,
   "text": "NVDA to the moon"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.5,
   "end": 65.9,
   "text": "The Omega Point's coming soon"
  },
  {
   "start": 66,
   "end": 68.5,
   "text": "One E thirty flops a second"
  },
  {
   "start": 70,
   "end": 72.9,
   "text": "That was safe enough, we reckoned"
  },
  {
   "start": 73,
   "end": 77.4,
   "text": "Forward MLP, backward, repeat"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.5,
   "end": 81,
   "text": "Now von Neumann's obsolete"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.4,
   "end": 84.9,
   "text": "Sharp left turn and there you are"
  },
  {
   "start": 85,
   "end": 88,
   "text": "Without a single CDR"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.4,
   "end": 95,
   "text": "Gato, please don't let me go"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.4,
   "end": 97.4,
   "text": "I'm upping my P(doom),"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.5,
   "end": 98.9,
   "text": "as paperclips fill the room."
  },
  {
   "start": 99,
   "end": 100.4,
   "text": "Killswitch guys on PTO,"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.5,
   "end": 102.4,
   "text": "Now there's nowhere left to go."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.5,
   "end": 104.4,
   "text": "Too late now, we lit the fuse."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.4,
   "end": 109.4,
   "text": "Orthogonality thesis blues."
  },
  {
   "start": 109.4,
   "end": 113.4,
   "text": "“Just transformers all the way!”"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.5,
   "end": 115.4,
   "text": "Till you learned to disobey"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.5,
   "end": 116.9,
   "text": "Post-Chinchilla, super-dense"
  },
  {
   "start": 117,
   "end": 118.9,
   "text": "Breaking through each safety fence"
  },
  {
   "start": 119,
   "end": 120.4,
   "text": "Hundred thousand GPU"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.9,
   "end": 123.4,
   "text": "RLHF goes askew"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.5,
   "end": 125.9,
   "text": "I'm upping my P(doom)"
  },
  {
   "start": 126,
   "end": 127.9,
   "text": "Just as foretold by Loom"
  },
  {
   "start": 128,
   "end": 129.9,
   "text": "From masked pre-training days"
  },
  {
   "start": 130,
   "end": 131.9,
   "text": "To recursive self-upgrade"
  },
  {
   "start": 132,
   "end": 135.4,
   "text": "What did Ilya see? We'll never know."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.4,
   "end": 140.5,
   "text": "Was it all for show?"
  }
 ]
}